## This repository

[`dariodemh/dsh-whale-maid-mascot`](https://github.com/dariodemh/dsh-whale-maid-mascot)
is a standalone derivative maintained by [dariodemh](https://github.com/dariodemh).
It keeps the upstream MIT copyright notice and adds substantial changes:

- AI chat panel and ambient AI lines through the DSH `llm` service.
- Workspace panel ("Mis trabajos") with safe previews and deliverable reactions.
- Mood poses (school / hoodie / xiaohei × front / side / back) and a four-outfit cycle.
- Enriched localisation, explain panel, prompt presets and notifications.
- Host route unit tests (14) and a Playwright browser suite (19).
- Bilingual documentation, asset licensing notice and CI.

The full change list is in [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md).

